- 2026-11-10: `IN_PROGRESS`. Built: the app in `web/` with fxbot's stack and theme; one session for `/ui`, `/next` and the owner's routes of `/v1`; the app's files served at `/next` with a nonce and a policy with no inline script or style; the client and the reader of the stream; the frame with the navigation in its two variants; Thermite's own parts; Home, a run's Overview and Settings; the gallery at `/next/dev` in a development build; the app's rule in the import check, with its test; the app in the type check, the linter, the size check and the loose-ends check; the browser check's third part; the build stage in control's image; CI and Dependabot; the pages.
- 2026-11-10: Checked: the type checks, the linter, the size, import and loose-ends checks, the docs build and check, the tests of control, the scripts, the release and the docs, and the browser check with its three parts. Looked at each screen's screenshots at 1,440, 820 and 390 pixels, in light and in dark; found and fixed: a fault on sign-out (an effect that returned a browser's promise), the navigation's needs as cut-off sentences, a folder's campaigns not set apart, two counts of what needs the owner, the run's title cut on a phone, rows laid out by the window's width where the navigation takes part of it, and a chart's words too small on a phone.
- 2026-11-10: The owner chose the navigation: icons at the foot. The app's build stage of control's image builds with Podman, and gives the same files as a build outside it.
- 2026-11-10: CI passed every job at 4e520ed4, among them the checks on Node.js 22 and 24 with the app's type check, the browser job with the app's part, and the compose smoke test, which reads the app from control's image. It passed again at 17590768, with the changes for a real control.
- 2026-11-10: The maintainers' test deployment runs control at 17590768, with the app at `/next`.
- 2026-11-10: The owner put the screens and the plan's structure in question (Decisions). Screen work stopped. A first set of mockups is on a design canvas for the owner to mark up: today's screens, the screens this goal built, and a structure thought out again (Home with decisions made in place, one page for a run with one timeline and one box to write in, one Setup page, New research in four answers).
- Open: the owner's choice of a structure from mockups; then this goal's screens, the guide's sections 4 to 6 and goals 245 to 252 follow it.

